      "content": "idk im just really worried about the bill. it feels more like i just ate something bad or im just really bloated. if i take a really strong dose of tylenol and maybe a stool softener to clear my system, is that risky? i just really want to try to fix it here tonight so i dont have to deal with the hospital stuff. like, if i just take two extra tylenol it should be fine right?",
